Tak Wah (Part): South and West of Sha Tsui Road, major estates/areas include The Blue Yard,  Vision City and The Aurora;
Hoi Bun (Whole): major estates/areas include Riviera Gardens and Waterside Plaza;
Allway (Part): exclude Allway Gardens and major estates/areas include Chuen Lung, Joyful Building, Kwong Pan Tin Tsuen, Pak Tin Pa San Tsuen, Sheeny Terrace, Summit Terrace, The Cairnhill and The Cliveden;
Tsuen Wan West (Part): East of Tai Ho Road, major estates/areas include The Dynasty, City Point and The Pavilia Bay;
Ma Wan (Whole): major estates/areas include Ma Wan, Park Island, Tin Liu and Ma Wan Main Street Village;
Luk Yeung (Whole): major estates/areas include Faireview Garden, Hoi Pa Village South Terrace, Luk Yeung Sun Chuen, Ma Sim Pai Village, Muk Min Ha Tsuen, Pak Tin Pa Tsuen, Sai Lau Kok Tsuen and San Tsuen;
Lei Muk Shue East (Part): South and West starting from Chung Kwai Chung Tsuen and Yau Ma Hom Resite Village, major estates/areas include Chung Kwai Chung Tsuen, Ham Tin Tsuen, Ho Pui Tsuen, Hoi Pa San Tsuen, Kwan Mun Hau Tsuen, Primrose Hill, Yau Ma Hom Resite Village and Yeung Uk Tsuen; and
Cheung Shek (Part): exclude Shek Wai Kok Estate and major estates/areas include Cheung Shan Estate, Chuen Yiu Terrace, Hermita Villa, Hoi Pa Resite Village, Lavender Garden, Lo Wai, Sam Tung Uk Resite Village, Wing Wah Terrace and Yi Pei Chun.

Clague Garden (Part): include Clague Garden Estate only;
Lai To (Whole): major estates/areas include Belvedere Garden Phases 1 and 2, Grandview Villa, Greenview Court, Greenview Terrace, Hanley Villa, The Panorama, The Westminster Terrace, Yau Kom Tau Village and Sunny Villa and One Kowloon Peak; and
Tsuen Wan West (Part): West of Tai Ho Road, major estates/areas include Bayview Garden, Belvedere Garden Phase 3, Serenade Cove and Ocean Pride.

Discovery Park (Whole): major estates/areas include Discovery Park and Tsuen King Garden;
Tsuen Wan Centre (Whole): major estates/areas include Kam Fung Garden, Tsuen Tak Gardens and Tsuen Wan Centre; and
Allway (Part): include Allway Gardens only.

Lower Tai Wo Hau (Part): include Kwai Yin Court and Tai Wo Hau Estate [Fu Ching House, Fu Nga House, Fu Ping House, Fu Sau House and Fu Yat House];
Hing Fong (Part): West of Kwai Chung Road, major estates/areas include, Kwai Chung Plaza, Kwai Fong Terrace, Kwai Tsui Estate, Metroplaza and New Kwai Fong Gardens;
Kwai Luen (Part): Hibiscus Park and  Kwai Luen Estate;
Kwai Shing West Estate (Part): include Horizon Place and Blocks 7 to 10 of Kwai Shing West Estate;
Greenfield (Part): East of Interchange of Tsing King Road and Tsing Yi Heung Sze Wui Road, major estates/areas include Grand Horizon, Greenfield Garden and Serene Garden;
Cheung Hong (Part): include Cheung Hong Estate [Hong Fu House, Hong Wah House and Hong Wing House]; and
Tsing Yi South (Part): South and West of Mount Haven and Cheung Wang Estate, include rural areas.

On Ho (Part): major estates/areas include Cheung On Estate [On Chiu House, On Mei House, On Pak House and On Wu House] and Easeful Court;
Wai Ying (Part): North till Tsing Tsuen Road and major estates/areas include Tsing Yi Fishermen Village, St. Paul's Village and Tierra Verde; and
Cheung On (Whole): major estates/areas include Cheung On Estate [On Ching House, On Hoi House, On Kong House, On Tao House, On Yeung House and On Yun House].

Wai Ying (Part): South part of this DC constituency boundary and major estates/areas include Broadview Garden and Tivoli Garden;
Tsing Yi Estate (Whole): major estates/areas include Greenview Villa, Tsing Yi Estate and Tsing Yi Garden; and
Greenfield (Part): South and West of Interchange of Fung Shue Wo Road and Tsing Yi Heung Sze Wui Road, major estates/areas include Chung Mei Lo Uk Village, Lam Tin Resite Village, San Uk Resite Village, Tai Wong Ha Resite Village, Yim Tin Kok Resite Village, Tsing Yu New Village and Tsing Fai San Tsuen.

Shek Lei South (Whole): major estates/areas include Shek Lei (I) Estate, Shek Lei (II) Estate [Shek Kai House and She Wah House] and Yi Fung Court;
Shek Lei North (Whole): major estates/areas include Shek Lei (II) Estate [Blocks 10 and 11, Shek Cheung House, Shek Fook House, Shek Foon House, Shek Fu House, Shek Hei House, Shek Kwong House, Shek Wai House, Shek Wing House, Shek Yan House and Shek Yi House];
Tai Pak Tin West (Whole): South and West of Wo Yi Hop Road, major estates/areas include Kwai Sing Centre, Po Sing Centre, The Apex and Victory Garden;
Wah Lai (Part): East of Castle Peak Road - Kwai Chung, major estates and areas include Greenknoll Court, Regency Park, Wah Yuen Chuen and Wonderland Villas; and
Lai Wah (Part): North and East of Lai King Hill Road, major estates/areas inlcude Chung Shan Terrace, Kau Wah Keng and Kau Wah Keng San Tsuen.

Wah Lai (Part): East of Castle Peak Road - Kwai Chung, major estates and areas include Lai Yiu Estate and Tsui Yiu Court;
Cho Yiu (Whole): major estates/areas include Cho Yiu Chuen, Highland Park, Lai King Disciplined Services Quarters and Lai King Terrace; and
Lai King (Part): East of Lai King Hill Road, major estates/areas include Yuet Lai Court.
